+/-- **`S_A` has the shape `OT.IsSimA`**: its coins are `coins_Gen + (coins_Sample + coins_Sample)`
+and it computes `OT.simAView` (`otSimA_coins`, `runAt_otSimA`, and the readers of `otSimAFun`,
